{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101469","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101469/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101469/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101469/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101469","id":2782683850,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc6l3GLK","number":101469,"title":"Disabling \"Script Editor\" feature disables the ability to open script files in an external editor as well.","user":{"login":"Crystalwarrior","id":3470436,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0NzA0MzY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3470436?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Crystalwarrior","html_url":"https://github.com/Crystalwarrior","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Crystalwarrior/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Crystalwarrior/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Crystalwarrior/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Crystalwarrior/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Crystalwarrior/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Crystalwarrior/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Crystalwarrior/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Crystalwarrior/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Crystalwarrior/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2025-01-12T20:44:05Z","updated_at":"2025-01-13T10:07:28Z","closed_at":"2025-01-13T10:07:25Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in Godot 4.3-stable\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.3.stable - Windows 10.0.19045 - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1650 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6614) - AMD FX(tm)-6300 Six-Core Processor (6 Threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nI want to use an external script editor. But I also want to disable the button for the internal script editor to break the habit of using it.\nHowever, when I set the external editor path, double-clicking a script file will only open it in the external editor ***if I still have the internal script editor enabled.*** This also means clicking on the button for \"Script\" will not open my external editor, but simply open the internal script editor instead.\n\nThere is no other way I know of to hide the \"Script\" button, meaning I'm stuck with it. I feel this is undesired behavior and an oversight of the editor features system.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n* [Configure an external editor](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/editor/external_editor.html)\n* Once you confirm it works, disable the Script Editor feature in Editor -> Manage Editor Features -> Configure Selected Profile, turn the \"Script Editor\" checkmark off.\n* Double-clicking on a script file now only opens its resource, it does not open the external editor to edit it.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AT